.TH tkdiff n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkdiff \- line diff viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkdiff
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkdiff::widget .w]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Tk front-end built on the tclutils engine. See docs/tkdiff.md for the full API.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget
